sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Scout as OutingScoutJob + pure checks
  participant Lead as Lead agent (memories, preferences)
  participant Helper as delegate helper
  participant Guard as Guard
  participant App as Android app

  Scout->>Scout: freeSlots(next 7 days), recentContacts(messaged in last 90 days)
  alt no free slot, or 2 look_forward posts this week
    Note over Scout: stop here, no model call
  else Thursday 18:00 to 22:00 free
    Scout->>Lead: JobDue with slots and recent contacts
    Lead->>Lead: search memory, mail and calendar as usual
    opt needs research
      Lead->>Helper: delegate(brief, checked for phone numbers and similar)
      Helper-->>Lead: options (title, time, place, url)
    end
    Lead->>App: send_to_user(kind = look_forward, sources + choices)
    Note over App: "Thursday evening is free. Jazz at the Blue Room with Sam Example?"
    alt Add to calendar
      App-->>Lead: "Add it to my calendar"
      Lead->>Guard: create_event
      Guard-->>Lead: allowed or asks for approval
    else Not this time (declines = true)
      App-->>Lead: "Not this time"
      Note over Lead: nothing added, no pause
    end
    Lead->>Lead: remember the kind of outing and the answer
  end
